 w. राज्यम् rule, bear sway. अभि indicate, direct, rule.
आ M.(A.) wish, pray or hope for (acc.);
 expect from (abl.);
 ±आशि॑षम्
& आशिषस् make supplication, utter wishes for (dat. or loc.). उद्
direct upwards (to the gods). प्र instruct, teach, direct, order,
command;
 dispose of, decide (acc. ±अधि);
 rule, govern (±राज्यम्).
संप्र w. राज्यम् bear sway, reign. वि give various instructions
about (acc.). सम् direct, bid, invite. — Cf. अ॑नुशिष्ट.

